<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AFK Bot for GrandRP 2560 x 1440 WQHD</Major>
    <Description>With this macro you can be AFK on the GrandRP server and at the same time place ads every 30 minutes through Lifeinvader.

Only works with 2560 x 1440 WQHD resolution.

The ad making section needs exacly 7 seconds

A random delay of 0-20 sec before the ad is set, can be replaced by an standard delay of 10 sec.

If you set the repetitions to 8 in line 44, the macro sends a advetisements every 60 minutes +- a few seconds. 
Default is every 30min
If you change the value of the repetitions by one, the time increases or decreases by exacly 5 minutes. 

By default, the program will advertise 4 times or 2 hours, which can be changed in line 45. When the advertising phase is over, the macro will only act as an AFK bot until the macro is switched off.

I recommend using AKF bots in closed areas like in your appartement, because there you most likely wont be kicked.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 450 ms
